## Relationship to upstream

This port re-implements STLCG from scratch in idiomatic Elixir using
`Nx` and `Nx.Defn`. No Python source is redistributed; semantics are
mirrored and verified via numerical parity fixtures generated from the
pinned upstream SHA (see `scripts/bootstrap_fixtures.sh`).
